{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01519","headline":"琴曲歌辞 湘夫人 · 邹绍先","name":"琴曲歌辞 湘夫人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"枫叶下秋渚，二妃愁渡湘。\n疑山空杳蔼，何处望君王？\n日落水云里，油油心自伤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"邹绍先","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01519.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01519","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}